OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FAny showers
OL,6,Fthis evening will quickly fade,
OL,7,Fleading to a clear and dry night.
OL,8,FUnder the clear skies it will feel
OL,9,Fcooler than last night with a few mist
OL,10,Fand fog patches developing. Winds
OL,11,Feasing overnight.
OL,12,
OL,13,CWednesday:FPlenty of sunshine around
OL,14,Fto start on Wednesday. Still feeling
OL,15,Fmild, with cloud building through the
OL,16,Fmorning. Winds strengthening through
OL,17,Fthe morning with again, stronger gusts
OL,18,Fover the hills.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
