OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FA
OL,6,Fdry start to Thursday, before a band
OL,7,Fof rain pushes southeastwards into
OL,8,FFriday, feeling markedly cooler in its
OL,9,Fwake with sunny spells and showers. A
OL,10,Fsunny, more settled weekend.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
